    "message": "Move the handlers' toilet, support and care rules to Rust\n\nKernels for append_applied_care_transition, ToiletServiceManager.request,\nthe toilet and resource completions, the support timeout and completion,\nseek_help and seek_information, _after_arrival and the walk home. Dispatch's\ntable holds the new event types, and each refused call runs the Python rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
